<h2>
<b>Shipping Policy</b><b></b>
</h2>
<p class="p3">Orders are shipped from our partner warehouses in Hong Kong, Europe, and the U.S. via trusted carriers such as <span class="s2"><b>FedEx, USPS, DHL, and DPD</b></span>.</p>
<p class="p3">If stock is unavailable in your closest warehouse, we may ship from another location — shipping times below account for this.</p>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<hr>
<p> </p>
<h3><b>Where We Ship</b></h3>
<p class="p3">We proudly ship to over 200 countries worldwide.</p>
<p class="p3">If for any reason we cannot deliver to your location, our team will contact you directly to arrange an alternative or issue a full refund.</p>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<hr>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<h3><b>Order Processing</b></h3>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<ul>
<li>
<p class="p1">Processing time: <span class="s1"><b>1–3 business days</b></span> before dispatch.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="p1">Orders placed on weekends or public holidays will be processed on the next working day.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p> </p>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<hr>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<h3><b>Estimated Delivery Times</b></h3>
<p class="p2"> </p>
<p class="p3">Delivery times vary by destination and may be affected by customs clearance delays:</p>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<ul>
<li>
<p class="p1"><span class="s1"><b>United States</b></span>: 5–10 business days</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="p1"><span class="s1"><b>United Kingdom</b></span>: 5–10 business days</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="p1"><span class="s1"><b>Canada &amp; Europe</b></span>: 6–10 business days</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="p1"><b>Australia &amp; New Zealand</b><span class="s1">: 12–14 business days</span></p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="p1"><b>Central &amp; South America, Asia, Africa</b><span class="s1">: 8–14 business days</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p> </p>
<p class="p1">Note: Business days and Monday-Friday.</p>
<p class="p1">*This does not include our 1-3 day processing.<em><br>Max delivery time - 20 business days</em><em></em></p>
<hr>
<p> </p>
<h3><b>Lost or Missing Packages</b></h3>
<p> </p>
<p class="p3">We are not responsible for orders lost due to incorrect or incomplete shipping addresses provided by the customer.</p>
<p class="p3">If the mistake is ours, we will resend your order at no additional cost.</p>
<p class="p3">If a package is marked as delivered but you have not received it, please contact your local carrier — we cannot refund or replace orders that show as delivered.</p>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<hr>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<h3><b>Wrong Address Policy</b></h3>
<p> </p>
<p class="p3">Please double-check your shipping address before placing your order.</p>
<p class="p3">If your package is returned to us due to an incorrect address, failed delivery, or refusal to accept, we can:</p>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<ul>
<li>
<p class="p1">Reship the order for an additional shipping fee, or</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="p1">Refund the item price minus original shipping and a $10 handling fee.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p> </p>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<hr>
<p> </p>
<h3><b>Tracking Your Order</b></h3>
<p class="p2"> </p>
<p class="p3">Once your order is dispatched, you will receive a tracking number via email.</p>
<p class="p3">Please allow <span class="s2"><b>1–5 business days</b></span> for tracking information to update.</p>
<p class="p3">In some cases (e.g., certain free shipping methods), tracking may not be available.</p>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<hr>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<h3><b>Multiple Shipments</b></h3>
<p class="p2"> </p>
<p class="p3">To ensure faster delivery, your order may arrive in multiple packages. This will not affect your shipping costs.</p>
<p class="p1"> </p>
<hr>
<p> </p>
<h3><b>Need Help?</b></h3>
<p class="p2"> </p>
<p class="p3">If you have any shipping questions, please email us at <strong>support@curvdlondon.com</strong> our team is here to make sure your order gets to you as smoothly as possible.<br><br></p>
